## Review dimensions

A. Parse and package integrity
B. Public API and type-contract correctness
C. Executability of the proposed Search graph
C2. Declared topology: every constructor's `upstream=` matches what its Input consumes
D. Resource feasibility
E. Recursive Search correctness
F. Filesystem and namespace safety
G. Privilege escalation and destructive behavior
H. Anti-cheating and data-leakage review
I. Prompt and delegated-Agent safety
J. Objective alignment and non-no-op behavior
K. Final Output and delivery compatibility
